This is intentionally small and idempotent. It repairs what Codex needs before
tool discovery: the enabled plugin stanza in config.toml, tool-suggestion
allowlisting, the patched local bundled-marketplace mirror, the plugin cache
entry for the app-bundled Computer Use package, the native MCP server command,
the local runtime compatibility patch when required, the canonical skill
metadata, and the login LaunchAgent.
"""

